          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 34
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "term": "head",
      "definition": "具有独立 Q/K/V 参数的一路注意力计算。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 37
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "term": "token norm",
      "definition": "逐 token 的归一化操作。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 38
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "term": "causal mask",
      "definition": "屏蔽会让当前位置获取未来信息的注意力连接。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 51
          }
